WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.083 --> 00:00:01.084
Eep.

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.711
Boop.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:04.421
Hello?

00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:07.341
♪ "Tomorrow" by Waxahatchee ♪

00:00:07.341 --> 00:00:10.552
Do you think my hearing aids
make me look...funny?

00:00:10.552 --> 00:00:11.553
♪♪

00:00:11.553 --> 00:00:13.347
♪ I don't see a problem ♪

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:14.514
♪♪

00:00:14.514 --> 00:00:15.682
[muffled] Are you deaf?

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:19.353
♪ I gotta follow my own path ♪

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:22.606
♪♪

00:00:22.606 --> 00:00:24.483
You can call me...

00:00:24.483 --> 00:00:26.360
El Deafo!

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.780
♪♪

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:30.864
[girls laughing]
Oh no!

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:34.618
Prepare for a monstrous
makeover, my deaf friend!

00:00:34.618 --> 00:00:36.286
Stop!
[girls gasp]

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.871
♪♪

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:39.039
Yeehaw!

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:40.040
[girls giggling]

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.458
♪♪

00:00:41.458 --> 00:00:44.878
Cece can hear Mrs. Sinklemen all
over the school!

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:46.630
Wow, that's impressive!

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.465
Where is Mrs. Sinklemen now?

00:00:48.465 --> 00:00:50.008
[toilet flushing]

00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:51.468
She just flushed.

00:00:51.468 --> 00:00:53.053
Oh my gosh!

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:55.347
♪♪

00:00:55.347 --> 00:00:57.432
[El Deafo] Woo-Hoo!

00:00:57.432 --> 00:00:58.725
Mrs. Sinklemen is coming!

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.394
Cece:
Go back to your seats!

00:01:00.394 --> 00:01:02.729
♪♪

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:06.024
That was awesome, you're a hero!

00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:08.652
I am El Deafo.

